提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":25.11,"default_fair_val":25.11,"premium_pct":-20.2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":10.2,"pe_forward":9,"pb_trailing":1.6,"pb_forward":1.4,"div_yield":5.57,"ps_ratio":3.8,"fcf_to_ev":5.7,"fcf_to_mcap":6.62,"liab_to_assets":35.5,"cash_to_assets":31.8,"current_ratio":1.67,"roe":15.7,"roa":10.1,"moat":{"ticker":"ZTO","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"中通快遞在中國物流市場建立了強大的品牌聲譽，以其可靠性和效率贏得了客戶的信任。雖然價格競爭激烈，但其品牌價值使其能夠在一定程度上維持定價能力，尤其是在對服務質量要求較高的客戶群體中。這種品牌忠誠度是其護城河的重要組成部分，使其能夠在市場波動中保持相對穩定的客戶基礎和利潤率。","comment_en":"ZTO Express has cultivated a strong brand reputation in China's logistics market, earning customer trust through reliability and efficiency. While price competition is intense, its brand value allows for a degree of pricing power, particularly among customer segments prioritizing service quality. This brand loyalty forms a significant part of its moat, enabling it to maintain a relatively stable customer base and profit margins amidst market fluctuations."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"物流行業的進入壁壘主要來自於運營網絡的建設和規模，而非專利或監管保護。ZTO 的核心競爭力在於其高效的運營和廣泛的網絡，這類資產不易通過專利來保護。雖然行業受到監管，但這些監管並未形成顯著的特許經營權壁壘，對所有參與者都適用，因此在專利和監管方面，ZTO 的護城河相對較弱。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the logistics industry stem primarily from the construction of operational networks and scale, rather than patents or regulatory protection. ZTO's core strengths lie in its efficient operations and extensive network, assets not easily protected by patents. While the industry is regulated, these regulations do not create significant franchise-like barriers and apply broadly to all participants, thus ZTO's moat in terms of patents and regulatory protection is relatively weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於依賴 ZTO 進行日常包裹遞送的企業客戶而言，更換物流供應商會帶來顯著的轉換成本。這包括重新談判合同、整合新的系統、培訓員工以及潛在的服務中斷風險。雖然對於小型個人用戶而言轉換成本較低，但對於 ZTO 的主要客戶群體，這種轉換成本提供了一定的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"For business clients relying on ZTO for their daily parcel deliveries, switching logistics providers entails considerable switching costs. These include renegotiating contracts, integrating new systems, training staff, and the potential risk of service disruptions. While switching costs are lower for small individual users, for ZTO's primary customer base, these costs provide a degree of customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"ZTO 的網絡效應體現在其龐大的包裹處理量和廣泛的配送網絡。隨著包裹量的增加，ZTO 能夠優化其路由和運營效率，從而降低單位成本，並提供更快的遞送速度。這反過來又吸引更多用戶和包裹，形成一個正向循環。這種網絡效應在中國這樣地域遼闊且包裹量巨大的市場中尤為顯著，構成了強大的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"ZTO's network effects are evident in its massive parcel handling volume and extensive delivery network. As parcel volume increases, ZTO can optimize its routing and operational efficiency, thereby reducing unit costs and offering faster delivery speeds. This, in turn, attracts more users and parcels, creating a virtuous cycle. This network effect is particularly pronounced in a vast market like China with enormous parcel volumes, forming a strong competitive barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"ZTO 作為中國最大的快遞公司之一，其規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。通過大規模採購、優化的物流網絡和高效率的自動化分揀中心，ZTO 能夠實現比小型競爭對手更低的單位運營成本。這種規模經濟效應使其能夠提供具有競爭力的價格，同時保持健康的利潤率，並抵禦價格戰。","comment_en":"As one of China's largest express delivery companies, ZTO's scale provides a significant cost advantage. Through bulk purchasing, optimized logistics networks, and highly efficient automated sorting centers, ZTO achieves lower per-unit operating costs than smaller competitors. This economy of scale allows it to offer competitive pricing while maintaining healthy profit margins and withstanding price wars."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"雖然 ZTO 擁有遍布中國的廣泛物流網絡，但這些地理資產並非獨一無二。其他大型物流公司同樣在中國各地建立了龐大的網絡。ZTO 的優勢在於其網絡的效率和密度，而非地理位置的獨特性。因此，在獨特的地理資產方面，其護城河相對較弱，因為競爭對手可以通過投資和時間來複製類似的網絡覆蓋。","comment_en":"While ZTO possesses an extensive logistics network across China, these geographical assets are not unique. Other major logistics companies have also established vast networks throughout China. ZTO's advantage lies in the efficiency and density of its network, rather than the uniqueness of its geographical locations. Therefore, its moat in terms of unique geographical assets is relatively weak, as competitors can replicate similar network coverage through investment and time."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"ZTO 在運營效率方面表現卓越，這得益於其對技術的廣泛應用，包括自動化分揀系統、智能路由規劃和數據分析。這些技術優化了包裹處理流程，減少了錯誤和延誤，並降低了人力成本。持續的技術投入和流程改進，使其能夠在快速增長的市場中保持領先地位，並提供高質量的服務。","comment_en":"ZTO excels in operational efficiency, driven by its extensive application of technology, including automated sorting systems, intelligent route planning, and data analytics. These technologies optimize parcel handling processes, reduce errors and delays, and lower labor costs. Continuous investment in technology and process improvements enables it to maintain a leading position in a rapidly growing market and deliver high-quality services."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ZTO 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了較高的水準。公司持續將資金投入到擴張網絡、升級技術和提高運營效率上，這些都是能夠鞏固其護城河的戰略性投資。同時，公司也保持了健康的資產負債表，並通過自由現金流進行了有效的股權回購，顯示出對股東價值的關注。","comment_en":"ZTO's management demonstrates a high level of capital allocation skill. The company consistently invests in expanding its network, upgrading technology, and enhancing operational efficiency – all strategic investments that fortify its moat. Concurrently, it maintains a healthy balance sheet and effectively utilizes free cash flow for share repurchases, indicating a focus on shareholder value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ZTO 通過提供可靠、高效且價格合理的物流服務，實現了較高的客戶保留率。其龐大的網絡和穩定的服務質量，使得企業客戶傾向於長期合作。雖然價格是重要因素，但服務的穩定性和便利性也是客戶留存的關鍵。通過不斷優化客戶體驗和提供增值服務，ZTO 能夠進一步鞏固客戶關係。","comment_en":"ZTO achieves high customer retention rates by providing reliable, efficient, and reasonably priced logistics services. Its extensive network and consistent service quality encourage long-term partnerships with business clients. While price is a significant factor, service stability and convenience are also crucial for retention. By continuously optimizing the customer experience and offering value-added services, ZTO can further solidify customer relationships."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ZTO 的商業模式具有較強的持久性，尤其是在中國龐大且持續增長的電子商務市場背景下。其核心競爭力——網絡效應和規模經濟——在短期內難以被顛覆。雖然行業面臨技術變革和潛在的新進入者，但 ZTO 憑藉其現有的基礎設施和運營效率，能夠較好地適應變化，並維持其市場地位。","comment_en":"ZTO's business model possesses strong durability, especially within the context of China's vast and continuously growing e-commerce market. Its core competitive advantages – network effects and economies of scale – are difficult to disrupt in the short term. Although the industry faces technological changes and potential new entrants, ZTO, with its existing infrastructure and operational efficiency, is well-positioned to adapt to changes and maintain its market position."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"ZTO 快遞展現了強大的經濟護城河，主要體現在其無可匹敵的網絡效應（M4）和規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5）。這兩者共同構成了其核心競爭力，使其能夠在中國競爭激烈的物流市場中保持領先地位。其品牌聲譽（M1）和卓越的運營效率（M7）進一步鞏固了這一優勢。雖然轉換成本（M3）和客戶保留（M9）提供了額外的黏性，但其護城河並非來自專利或獨特地理資產（M2, M6）。管理層的資本配置能力（M8）和業務的持久性（M10）也為其長期價值提供了支持。整體而言，ZTO 的護城河更接近於一個高效運轉的『收費橋』，通過規模和網絡效應，為龐大的包裹流量提供基礎設施服務並收取費用。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"ZTO Express exhibits a robust economic moat, primarily driven by its unparalleled network effects (M4) and cost advantages derived from economies of scale (M5). These two factors form its core competitive strength, enabling it to maintain a leading position in China's highly competitive logistics market. Its brand reputation (M1) and exceptional operational efficiency (M7) further solidify this advantage. While switching costs (M3) and customer retention (M9) provide additional stickiness, its moat does not stem from patents or unique geographical assets (M2, M6). Management's capital allocation prowess (M8) and the business's durability (M10) also support its long-term value. Overall, ZTO's moat resembles an efficiently operated 'toll bridge,' leveraging scale and network effects to provide essential infrastructure for vast parcel flows and collecting fees.","evidenceHash":"3f025c8c95bc0650faa24f0524face570d066504bb1a1d9ffd56b1768274f24f","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ZTO.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ZTO.png","website":"https://www.zto.com","ceo":"Meisong Lai","full_time_employees":"23888","description":"ZTO Express (Cayman) Inc. is a leading provider of expedited parcel delivery and integrated logistics services throughout the People's Republic of China. The company facilitates shipments for a diverse clientele, including online retailers, traditional businesses, and various other entities requiring swift courier solutions. By the end of 2021, specifically December 31, its operations were supported by a substantial vehicle network comprising approximately 10,900 trucks. The firm was established in 2002 and maintains its primary corporate offices in Shanghai, China.","description_en":"ZTO Express (Cayman) Inc. is a leading provider of expedited parcel delivery and integrated logistics services throughout the People's Republic of China. The company facilitates shipments for a diverse clientele, including online retailers, traditional businesses, and various other entities requiring swift courier solutions. By the end of 2021, specifically December 31, its operations were supported by a substantial vehicle network comprising approximately 10,900 trucks. The firm was established in 2002 and maintains its primary corporate offices in Shanghai, China.","description_zh":"**中通快遞（開曼）股份有限公司 (ZTO)**\n\n中通快遞（開曼）股份有限公司為中國大陸領先的快遞包裹遞送及整合物流服務供應商。公司致力於為廣泛的客戶群提供高效的貨運解決方案，客戶涵蓋線上零售商、傳統企業及其他各類有快速貨運需求的實體。\n\n截至2021年12月31日，中通快遞已建立起龐大的運輸網絡，擁有約10,900輛貨車作為營運支援。公司成立於2002年，總部設於中國上海。其核心業務聚焦於提供快速、可靠的包裹遞送服務，並透過整合的物流網絡，滿足電商及傳統產業日益增長的貨運需求。","address":"Building One","city":"Shanghai","state":"SH","zip":"201708","country":"CN","phone":"86 21 5980 4508","full_address":"Building One, Shanghai, SH 201708, CN","range_52w":"18.18-26.2","year_high":26.2,"year_low":18.18,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":18.18,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"Zhu Wei WZ","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Yan Huiping","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":15248,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Yan Huiping","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":15248,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Yan Huiping","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":15248,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Wang Jilei","title":"director, officer: VP of Infrastr. Mgmt.","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":13108,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Wang Jilei","title":"director, officer: VP of Infrastr. Mgmt.","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":13108,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Wang Jilei","title":"director, officer: VP of Infrastr. Mgmt.","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":13108,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Lai Meisong","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":154000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Lai Meisong","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":154000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-24","name":"Lai Meisong","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":154000,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"ZTO","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"ZTO Express (Cayman) Inc.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T14:15:45.258Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/ZTO.json"}},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
